  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With 6-point fullbody tracking, setting the IK to be head locked causes one of my avatars' spine to twist nearly 30 degrees to the side and offsets the hip to the side. The avatar is fine if the IK is set to be locked to just the hip or to both the hip and head, or if the IK is reverted to the old behavior. \nNote the avatar used to have similar issues with the old IK system, with the hip twisting as well as the head being offset, but I mostly fixed it by moving the hip bone up.\nThe avatar ID is avtr_0112d87c-36d8-4ae7-aa31-2a4d9093c054",
